{"ordinal": 6893, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455600939016", "key": "line:talk_couple_3_0f4425c", "source": "Выдать явку в КЧС", "target": "Înmânează ordinul de prezentare la Comitet", "sourceSha256": "5a4267c888b5177ef13ed5321f19b5dae8dfa7534a48e1c875905db407733900", "targetSha256": "8564884b15252b12138290a5ee0c4d183c200e4e07f5f56a03b291f7bc631a2e", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "talk_couple_3", "instruction": 14, "opcode": 4}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["v2-document-transfer-guard-and-callback", "couple-past-night-context"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 7980, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455219257354", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_Disappointed_06399ac", "source": "Doctor: Давайте начнём вот с чего…", "target": "Doctor: Să începem cu următorul lucru…", "sourceSha256": "c011fed14581926e75846bdd8f5f607eed4d1757bb8232078e52f49abd08422d", "targetSha256": "b13d25bef63350e14b6f5d2193679dcc0489ff0590ffec65121df401d4715a4d", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Disappointed", "instruction": 1, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 7981, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455219257353", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_Disappointed_0316c92", "source": "Doctor: А для чего вы это спрашиваете? Хотите узнать, почему я не доверяю КЧС?", "target": "Doctor: Dar de ce mă întrebați asta? Vreți să aflați de ce nu am încredere în Comitet?", "sourceSha256": "87e80e966ec027d39a4bd132cfdf9b9866f72aedc5359cd9ec69f54ab08d1295", "targetSha256": "5732684d258339a18b3879281c40e52227ed90235549930883bc69a13c0a6f3a", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Disappointed", "instruction": 0, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8003, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868747", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_0d98472", "source": "Вы жалкий трус. Проваливайте из моего дома", "target": "Sunteți un laș jalnic. Plecați din casa mea", "sourceSha256": "61f169af2123ca81bf4a969ec9375025fcbb28a9c0485f40a0661a121ac076d5", "targetSha256": "af2a3a4bc4ca3336550c55672d8367723d74c1e0452618e5e3a6de6d8ecad905", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 13, "opcode": 4}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8004, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868746", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_049d199", "source": "Но вы всё ещё можете помогать людям.", "target": "Dar încă puteți ajuta oamenii.", "sourceSha256": "ac8a39175d42bbafc5318bb434ca6147761da188b8934257b11413db2c00c389", "targetSha256": "3946c87c2fe07c6a1c579b6cbbca6840f731a7af3564dcc134ec9d1b9d530ab9", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 12, "opcode": 4}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8005, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868745", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_072cac0", "source": "Я вас не осуждаю", "target": "Nu vă judec", "sourceSha256": "ee0a38d8b75c60e2571c98be82f4048fa8c236a26545d7961cd5cd1162b3b145", "targetSha256": "d5e75660e9935aa13f99b7d86526e4d37febeb372daf6823daddec97eeba545e", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 11, "opcode": 4}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8006, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868744", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_0cabac2", "source": "Doctor: Вы не представляете, как мне стыдно… Перед теми, кто там остался. Перед собой… Перед всеми…", "target": "Doctor: Nici nu vă imaginați cât de rușine îmi este… Față de cei care au rămas acolo. Față de mine… Față de toți…", "sourceSha256": "3e0fb0a8bcbd118c47ac47e02ec37b8bc8b43a41f3db1713720547af300f36ae", "targetSha256": "61dfde4cd5065db1c35f6fa0fedddf759ed7c4f9304d5e5d4d1db1643382e5cb", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 10, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8007, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868743", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_098e2c5", "source": "Doctor: И сбежал… Как трус…", "target": "Doctor: Și am fugit… Ca un laș…", "sourceSha256": "9461b620b00e41a013dc8c59c833a2de82f87710266997acc072cd457b280832", "targetSha256": "9b63a1ddd63c472f6d727e777af8377d50ccb926a1dfc7f22b3ab5db1dfad5d9", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 9, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8008, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868742", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_022327a", "source": "Doctor: В тот момент я так сильно испугался, что совсем не думал о спасении других…", "target": "Doctor: Atunci mi-a fost atât de frică, încât nici nu m-am gândit să-i salvez pe ceilalți…", "sourceSha256": "32288eb827f7fcb0025e0d64ab2cb43234a73c0e6c0448cb5b6aba8a161c2d04", "targetSha256": "8cf192a86f9145eae35da5ccfb164560e8179a9a40bb5ee90b9ca712ab645bdf", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 8, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8009, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868741", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_0524bc0", "source": "Doctor: Никогда я так сильно не боялся за свою жизнь…", "target": "Doctor: Niciodată nu m-am temut atât de mult pentru viața mea…", "sourceSha256": "8324760a9527df63237567f23e6abe294e2b87c29b1fe4b5354be82a602074d7", "targetSha256": "1d5c50dd0be283f1af7c350099a44bb808d9d6b2a9e87c6f1229b65a77c93652", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 7, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8010, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868740", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_020786c", "source": "Doctor: А после он рассмеялся, сказав, что плохой из меня врач, раз я не знаю, что язык - не признак Гостя. И отпустил…", "target": "Doctor: Apoi a râs și mi-a spus că sunt un medic prost dacă nu știu că limba nu este un semn de Musafir. Și mi-a dat drumul…", "sourceSha256": "7df80f67fe79358d202d772a74e921fd47b44a77c57420ad5e0bf91f8c462903", "targetSha256": "7f5f14bf2bc9a0dcd415bbcc3511ea751d83493d8d6fc3c8df4024531a045123", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 5, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8011, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868739", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_08d9664", "source": "Doctor: Сказал высунуть язык, чтобы проверить меня на Гостя, и я это сделал, боясь, что иначе меня застрелят.", "target": "Doctor: Mi-a spus să scot limba, ca să mă verifice dacă sunt Musafir, iar eu am făcut-o, de teamă că altfel mă va împușca.", "sourceSha256": "d146ddef7564b0078f74bcf8454ce014c0a80abf9f909752cb80efddff63c3a9", "targetSha256": "b0f1d03ff2d4986460ac156a41058b4a0404fcc58493a4d83f41bea3b371e8f7", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 4, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8012, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868738", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_07f9c95", "source": "Doctor: КЧС-ник навёл автомат на мои ноги и сказал замереть на месте. Он всё всматривался, а потом…", "target": "Doctor: Un agent al Comitetului și-a îndreptat arma automată spre picioarele mele și mi-a poruncit să rămân nemișcat. M-a privit atent, iar apoi…", "sourceSha256": "707785a2e0fb5a350b35ac0ed56a90d766e92766d40cd6036f6eda119baa83c9", "targetSha256": "079d535e7d931fb349db5597283c2f5fab22e0d50b659f23c7afce9d3f374367", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 3, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8013, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868737", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_044f715", "source": "Doctor: Строгим рёвом мне приказали развернуться. Я уже готов был принять смерть…", "target": "Doctor: O voce aspră mi-a poruncit să mă întorc. Eram deja pregătit să mor…", "sourceSha256": "0f93685dc8922eae20ba38838239f17005666292862a9ccced78c71e8fc4bb48", "targetSha256": "3606e5fb4b88a4713c04bae8662c58bb420bbc6c60f73c68eda0e6bd765732b9", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 2, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8014, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455210868736", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_0cb6b31", "source": "Doctor: В тот момент моё сердце бешено заколотилось и подкосились колени.", "target": "Doctor: În clipa aceea, inima îmi bătea nebunește și mi s-au înmuiat genunchii.", "sourceSha256": "8269a959bb5a4ec629b11523cc8b88a5db283016f9182589ea3c0c6a69fe7b08", "targetSha256": "6652e87536e4ded6d4c20b3580daf95a7ee34441015fe100d58c7dd6c8dc75eb", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 1, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8015, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455206674444", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_014b46c", "source": "Doctor: Уже светало. Я собирался домой, как вдруг меня окликнул один из КЧС-ников.", "target": "Doctor: Se crăpa de ziuă. Mă pregăteam să merg acasă, când unul dintre agenții Comitetului m-a strigat.", "sourceSha256": "c33b6cfb8275986fafa8cad9fe7c10c38f552a2d75351c4ed9ce68bdef3ca66e", "targetSha256": "261798e2b52d7af6bd9591124757ac1a07ca9990cbb672127972b64255a7cfd3", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3_Backstory", "instruction": 0, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8016, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455206674443", "key": "line:Doctor_Asking_3_0e63db0", "source": "Doctor: Всё случилось после одного происшествия…", "target": "Doctor: Totul a urmat unui incident…", "sourceSha256": "d8fbc54588edabdcf91bf6a4b6e3033ce09429675028d7c9deea8a78d443e2a5", "targetSha256": "2bd951b85fe10a24d5364bb70cd32929d85d89cc5f75020c82d6d9ad331e6995", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "Doctor_Asking_3", "instruction": 14, "opcode": 2}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
{"ordinal": 8017, "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504455206674442", "key": "line:talk_doctor_3_09f0440", "source": "Мне надо тебя проверить", "target": "Trebuie să te verific", "sourceSha256": "df657a1a34f66efcb843aceedf88e6d07994a5288b2282ecd83719103aaa7e9b", "targetSha256": "c6136a5c74939784b06ade2af0a96673b12b4bd9cb7823ffa3d347edae775d2e", "fullSourceAndCurrentTargetRead": true, "compiledPlacements": [{"node": "talk_doc_3", "instruction": 7, "opcode": 4}], "decision": "no-objective-correction-in-context-unit", "mandatoryRegressions": ["doctor-quarantine-chronology"], "boundary": "Independent full pair read with ordered compiled source context; no live game or rendered text."}
